<title>USA: Technology Solutions Co Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Technology Solutions Co Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended Feb 28.</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.22		    $0.05</p>
<p> Net			  3,993			768</p>
<p> Revs			42,346		   25,466</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  17,894		   16,377</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.56		    $0.12</p>
<p> Net			  9,864		    1,966</p>
<p> Revs		     114,029		   69,498</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  17,578		   16,022</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q3 includes $944,000 litigation settlement charge.</p>
<p>Per share figures reflect three-for-two stock split effective July 1996.</p>
<p>1996 nine month period includes $3.3 million in litigation settlement charges.</p>
